Package: ValCurvaR
Type: Package
Title: Validation of Analytical Calibration Curves
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Isaquiel", family = "Silva", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "isaquebrand@gmail.com")
Description: Provides transparent tools for fitting and evaluating analytical
    calibration curves. Ordinary and weighted least squares fits are supported,
    together with lack-of-fit, heteroscedasticity and influence diagnostics,
    back-calculation, prediction uncertainty and publication-ready base graphics.
    The workflow is designed to support validation studies rather than rely on
    a single goodness-of-fit statistic.
